# Finding: the sheet's id/amount set (server payable set) excludes #91430 (pending + paid), but the Switch action's
# target set (NEARS-3944 GroupRecoveryChild.isSwitchTarget = unsettled && !switched && method!=wallet; no paid check)
# still includes it, and PUT customer/order/payment-method has no payment_status guard (OrderController::update_payment_method
# checks order_status pending/failed only) -> a PAID order is flipped to cash_on_delivery.
# Base-equivalent (code read, base 1e58fe464): base no-id payment-failed has no payment_status filter, so the base sheet would show
# '#91430' itself (highest unpaid) and its single-child Switch would PUT 91430 the same way -> pre-existing server gap.
# State requires an anomalous 'paid while pending' child (fixture on copy). Not this ticket's AC (ids/amount correct).
